    { title: 'Commodity Traders', description: 'Market development, aggregation, quality and specifications, logistics, commercial contracts, secondary commodities, feedstocks, environmental attributes, and diligence.' },
    { title: 'Technology & Solution Providers', description: 'Market entry, customer discovery, feedstock and workflow fit, technical and commercial diligence, pilots, partnerships, channel strategy, and investor or buyer support.' },
